OL,3,GNEWSAMelon and aubergine success in hot
OL,4,Asummer experiment
OL,5,
OL,6,FTim Mitchell, who runs the
OL,7,Fwildlife-friendly kitchen garden at
OL,8,FAsthall Manor, said the project aimed
OL,9,Fto see whether "outdoor-friendly
OL,10,Fvarieties" could now be grown at scale
OL,11,Fin the UK.
